[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#FF6600]🎃 Halloween Plugin v3.2.0 - Minecraft 26.x Support 🎃[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B]Compatibility release for Paper/Spigot 26.1, 26.2 and 26.3[/B][/SIZE]

Minecraft moved to year-based versions (26.1, 26.2, ...) and Paper 26.x dropped the legacy [FONT=courier new]Attribute.GENERIC_*[/FONT] API. This release updates the plugin so it builds and runs on the new servers.

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]🔧 What Changed[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

✅ Uses the current [FONT=courier new]Attribute.MAX_HEALTH / ATTACK_DAMAGE / MOVEMENT_SPEED[/FONT] API
✅ Built against Paper API 26.2 (Java 21 bytecode) - still Spigot compatible
✅ [FONT=courier new]api-version: 1.21[/FONT]
✅ Existing configs (v3.0.5 - v3.1.1) are auto-merged, nothing to edit

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]📋 Requirements[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[B]Server:[/B] Spigot / Paper / Purpur [B]1.21.3+[/B] (including 26.1 / 26.2 / 26.3)
[B]Java:[/B] 21+ (Paper 26.x needs Java 25)

[COLOR=#FF0000][B]Still on 1.21.1 or 1.21.2?[/B][/COLOR] Stay on v3.1.1 - the new Attribute names don't exist on those versions.

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B][COLOR=#FF6600]⬆️ Upgrade[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

Drop-in replacement for v3.1.1: stop server → swap the JAR → start. No config changes required.
